{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "6ca68b16ae01705b86439f4cf00794bc601cf04ecd0ee2e97cbd5ceafed93d65", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄的工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8000_place", "source_sha256": "bbee113339e80531308ba11378272b267cb033f728917cb9a77056c1e854952d", "ja": "砂浜", "zh": "沙滩", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8001_p", "source_sha256": "041e21eabcafa1f90f1302d0a5ae41840275ee3f8e39652e7b90c5da0bb1dee9", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画で、\n歌織さんは『水辺の舞姫』というテーマで撮影する）", "zh": "（在偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真企划中，歌织小姐将以“水边的舞姬”为主题进行拍摄）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8002_052kao", "source_sha256": "d0c753d7827421c937949a663509f91afa74176d1b391235e7c410a859edb3c0", "ja": "ふふっ……本当に、いい景色ですね。\n私も、素敵な写真になるように頑張らないと！", "zh": "呵呵……景色真的很美呢。\n我也得努力拍出漂亮的照片才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8003_052kao", "source_sha256": "8302d69043563668a43bf152878f8376ce42b478e7ac5bf85fa5a0a95147e0f0", "ja": "舞姫は、美しい舞で人々を魅了するんですよね……。\n目指すところは、なんとなくわかるんですけど。", "zh": "舞姬会用优美的舞姿吸引人们，对吧……。\n我大概明白要以此为目标，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8004_052kao", "source_sha256": "ebd5bf1d127c743012cf6455968e6f0c1d67f02338432064129c65446ea46488", "ja": "幻想的にするのか、それとも、元気にしたいのか。\n方向性によって、全然変わってきますよね。", "zh": "是要表现得梦幻唯美，还是想要展现活力呢？\n根据方向的不同，风格就会完全不一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8005_p", "source_sha256": "946f7f8cf4a0bb2fe30031e8949cdfe2e4fe8f089e697352fdfcbdee7bb7d289", "ja": "ええ、そうです、でも……歌織さんの中で、\n大体のイメージは固まってそうですね？", "zh": "嗯，是的，不过……歌织小姐心里应该已经有大致的构想了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8006_052kao", "source_sha256": "0fa0215c56f2953163516b57db06785aa10e841ea4bfe9b575a4d8e675f5ad3b", "ja": "はい。なので、{$P$}さんの意見を\n聞いて、細かい調整をしようかと思うんです。", "zh": "是的。所以我想先听听{$P$}先生的意见，再做一些细节上的调整。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8007_p", "source_sha256": "1843664a766e649e65204aed6ec083f4cea98359975e22a13f0e945156362a34", "ja": "そういうことでしたか。\nわかりました、それなら……。", "zh": "原来是这么回事啊。明白了，那样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8008", "source_sha256": "06bf688273289a77d48d5da2442afea17e0b7e0bf048e9df18c4c62fca3bc618", "ja": "穏やかに", "zh": "平静地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8009", "source_sha256": "6c41fe3b0e745d8be323ce93b63047b03d140d794f12b32777a11166ec0adbe1", "ja": "元気に", "zh": "打起精神来", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8010", "source_sha256": "a6cb1ef89d4aeb14fc880aa3a5adf4d310a216ebd8a3ce748f091a5f29eb7bb1", "ja": "大胆に", "zh": "大胆地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8100_p", "source_sha256": "20a3167299cc00c1838c49dddf12fa7b85fc8b200fcc0e934aed67506b559def", "ja": "穏やかで落ち着いた方向は、どうですか？\n景色と相まって、舞姫らしい雰囲気になるかと。", "zh": "走温和沉稳的方向怎么样？和景色结合起来，应该会营造出很有舞姬风情的氛围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8101_052kao", "source_sha256": "3726fedca01c211e3b56573206722799244fa241fb26690b879711708ec7e5d7", "ja": "わあ……！　私も幻想的な感じがいいかなって\n思ってたんです。ふふっ、一緒ですね♪", "zh": "哇……！我也觉得幻想般的感觉比较好。呵呵，我们想到一块儿去了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8102_052kao", "source_sha256": "8547c226b9e680ee250d6b605c290a00f7257d7d4fb4698e21569efbad08ffc2", "ja": "では、この水辺をイメージしてやってみますね。\n風も気持ちいいし、リラックスしてできそうです♪", "zh": "那么，就以这片水边为灵感来试试看吧。\n风也很舒服，感觉能放松地完成呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8200_p", "source_sha256": "0cda42edff485d96bc84ef1d806701d05ab98d8f18c69b93a1bef8a983770a50", "ja": "ここは、元気にやってみるのはどうでしょうか？\n写真を見た人が、元気をもらえるような感じで。", "zh": "要不要在这里试着表现得精神一点？\n给看到照片的人一种能从中获得活力的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8201_052kao", "source_sha256": "a87084f2796e73c57bd84b937e14d97f3e68bacac13a0e9997231a34dae19056", "ja": "見た人が元気に……。あ、海には\n楽しいイメージもありますからね。なるほど。", "zh": "见到的人能打起精神……啊，大海也有让人感到快乐的印象呢。原来如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8202_052kao", "source_sha256": "0c4a6452371cba9bff67df2b765395e626e3220521b990d328ab9ee4f4592a1d", "ja": "では、{$P$}さん。イメージ\nトレーニングも兼ねて、少しだけ歩きませんか？", "zh": "那么，{$P$}先生。就当作意象训练，我们稍微走走吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8300_p", "source_sha256": "0acb4b48f06e5012a6727b1d90cc31ee409962846c1244964cb7791835be41bd", "ja": "グラビアは、思いきりが大切です。ここは大胆に、\n衣装と歌織さんを前面に出していきましょう！", "zh": "拍摄写真时，放开手脚很重要。这里就大胆一些，把服装和歌织小姐放在最前面吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8301_052kao", "source_sha256": "1772b58252c002bcd347eec48920576ae71e13c6f1eab6c8611a652882dbba1d", "ja": "ええっ！？　そんな……\nたしかに海で水着の撮影ではありますけど……。", "zh": "诶！？怎么会……\n确实是在海边拍泳装照没错……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_8302_052kao", "source_sha256": "cea786ba1f884c4dd7c8561f2259be3c9085699cf5e6f5d781f0b602821253d8", "ja": "それだと、舞姫ってテーマから外れちゃいませんか？\n……もう一度、自分で考えてみます。", "zh": "那样的话，不就偏离“舞姬”这个主题了吗？\n……我再自己想想看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
